        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Carroll Lynch, Nick Offerman, Richard McDonald, Maurice McDonald, Logan Sparks, Drago Sumonja\n- Works: The Drew Carey Show, The Founder, Lucky, American Horror Story\n- Roles: Steve Carey, Twisty the Clown\n\nFacts:\n- John Carroll Lynch is known for television work on the ABC sitcom The Drew Carey Show as Steve Carey, the title character's cross-dressing brother.\n- John Carroll Lynch also portrayed Twisty the Clown on American Horror Story.\n- In The Founder, Nick Offerman and John Carroll Lynch co-star as McDonald's founders Richard McDonald and Maurice McDonald.\n- Lucky is a 2017 American drama film directed by John Carroll Lynch.\n- Lucky was written by Logan Sparks and Drago Sumonja.",
